OL,3,GNEWSABomb hoaxes across Europe disrupt
OL,4,Aflights as two UK airports also receive
OL,5,Athreats
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 21 flights across Europe have
OL,8,Fbeen impacted by bomb threats - a list
OL,9,Fof what journeys we know have been
OL,10,Faffected
OL,12,FIt comes days after seven flights were
OL,13,Faffected by similar threats
OL,15,FBoth London Heathrow and Birmingham
OL,16,FAirports say they received threats
OL,17,Fearlier on Thursday, with Heathrow
OL,18,Fsaying its was "deemed not credible"
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
