OL,3,GNEWSABomb hoaxes across Europe disrupt
OL,4,Aflights as two UK airports also receive
OL,5,Athreats
OL,6,
OL,7,FAirport authorities in Rome say they
OL,8,Freceived one via email from a group
OL,9,Fcalled "Fighters of the Male State",
OL,10,Fclaiming to be targeting a "feminist
OL,11,Fregime"
OL,13,FAn Aer Lingus flight from Dublin to
OL,14,FRome was diverted to a French military
OL,15,Fair base - one passenger tells the BBC
OL,16,F"we were all trying to be as calm as we
OL,17,Fcould"
OL,19,FMeanwhile, military fighter jets
OL,20,Fescorted one plane into Rome Fiumicino
OL,21,FAirport and three aircraft to airports
OL,22,Fin Sofia
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
